 features**\n- **Scheduled tasks and remote control capabilities**\n\nThe updates emphasize automation, improved user experience, and deeper integration with development workflows. The `/loop` feature transforms manual debugging into an auto-pilot system that iterates, fixes, and tests until issues are resolved.\n\nFor the most detailed and official information, you can check the [Claude Code Docs \"What's New\" page](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
