-quality\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-23\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]",
  "new_string": "[\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.131 - Critical Windows Fix and Endpoint Improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"Fixed VS Code extension failing to activate on Windows due to hardcoded build path bug. Also fixed Mantle endpoint authentication with missing x-api-key header.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.129 - Plugin Enhancements and Usability Improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"Added --plugin-url flag for fetching plugins from URLs, CLAUDE_CODE_FORCE_SYNC_OUTPUT for terminal compatibility, and auto-update for package manager installations. Improved Ctrl+R history search, Gateway model discovery (opt-in), and numerous bug fixes.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.128 - UI/UX Improvements and MCP Enhancements\",\n    \"description\": \"Bare /color command picks random color, /mcp shows tool counts, --plugin-dir accepts .zip archives. Updated /model picker with improved UI. Fixed MCP server connection issues and numerous rendering bugs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-04\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.126 - Gateway Model Discovery and Project Management\",\n    \"description\": \"The /model picker now lists models from gateway's /v1/models endpoint. Added claude project purge command, improved OAuth flow, and Windows PowerShell 7 detection. Fixed image handling and numerous security issues.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.123 - OAuth Authentication Fix\",\n    \"description\": \"Fixed OAuth authentication failing with 401 retry loop when CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1 is set.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-29\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.122 - Bedrock Service Tier and PR URL Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Added ANTHROPIC_BEDROCK_SERVICE_TIER environment variable, PR URL paste support in /resume search box, and improved /mcp management. Enhanced OpenTelemetry logging and fixed numerous bugs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.121 - Performance Improvements and Plugin System\",\n    \"description\": \"Added alwaysLoad option to MCP servers, claude plugin prune command, and type-to-filter search box for /skills. Fixed memory leaks (up to ~2GB), improved scrolling, and enhanced dialog handling.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.120 - Windows PowerShell Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Git for Windows no longer required - Claude Code uses PowerShell when Git Bash is absent. Added claude ultrareview subcommand for CI/CD, improved /skills menu, and numerous bug fixes.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]"
}

